{"words": [{"text": "۞ أَتَأْمُرُونَ", "translation": "Do you order"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translation": "[the] people"}, {"text": "بِٱلْبِرِّ", "translation": "[the] righteousness"}, {"text": "وَتَنسَوْنَ", "translation": "and you forget"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَكُمْ", "translation": "yourselves"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "while you"}, {"text": "تَتْلُونَ", "translation": "[you] recite"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۚ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "أَفَلَا", "translation": "Then, will not"}, {"text": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "you use reason"}], "sahih": "Do you order righteousness of the people and forget1 yourselves while you recite the Scripture? Then will you not reason?"}